# PART 5 — MAIN STORY CONNECTION

Although the kingdoms have different rulers, they must belong to one coherent story.

Carmilla is secretly manipulating the vampire rulers.

An ancient ritual known as the Blood Ascension allows its user to control blood, life and death.

The six vampire rulers possess different parts of the ritual's power.

Carmilla has been using their territories to prepare her ascension.

The Undying Kingdom is an unintended consequence of her experiments with immortality and necromancy.

The player gradually discovers:

- Why the vampire kingdoms exist.
- Why the rulers possess different supernatural powers.
- Why the zombie kingdom is spreading.
- Why Carmilla is manipulating the other rulers.
- What the Blood Ascension will do to the world.

Defeating the vampire rulers reveals parts of the truth.

The final confrontation with Carmilla must resolve the chapter's central story.

Do not modify the existing four chapters' main story or endings.

Use the existing quest and dialogue architecture.

